 "description": "Since the platform-dependence of [String.to\\*Case()](http://java.sun.com/javase/6/docs/api/java/lang/String.html#toLowerCase()) is usually not intended, developers will specify a fixed locale when doing the case transformation (compare [Common Bug #3](http://www.nabble.com/Re%3A-Common-Bugs-p14931921s177.html)). There are currently not related methods in StringUtils."
}

